  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FIAS Investeringsklimatsreform 2011-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fac for Investment Climate Adv Serv FIAS 2011-2015 - FIAS Investement Climate Reform 2011-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FIAS startades 1985 i syfte att tillhandah&#xe5;lla r&#xe5;dgivning kring FDI   till mottagarl&#xe4;nder. Sida har st&#xf6;tt den globala faciliteten sedan     2007. Den aktuella insatsen t&#xe4;cker perioden 2011-2015 med en budget   p&#xe5; MSEK 50. Fokus kommer att ligga fr&#xe4;mjande av f&#xf6;retagande och       tillv&#xe4;xt samt underl&#xe4;tta internationell handel och investeringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIAS was established by IFC in 1985 to provide advice on foreign      direct investment (FDI) to client countries.  Sida has been           supporting FIAS Global Facility since 2007, with a total budget of 10 MSEK. This contribution covers the period 2011-2015 with a budge of   MSEK 50. Focus will be on fostering enterprise creation and growth    and facilitating international trade and investment.</narrative>
  </description>
